Conventions numbering and ordering rules
title end

paragraph start
Numbers have two digits and follow the order in which the work happens in practice, from the first step to the last. They do not rank importance.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Numbers restart inside every folder. Zero zero is always the purpose file. In the root, the notation usage guide is zero zero, the introduction is zero one, these rules are zero two, and the areas start at zero three.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Two subjects never share a number in the same folder, and numbers are not skipped, so the sequence always reads without gaps.
paragraph end

